# Cursor AI Rules for JaoKob
# You MUST strictly adhere to AGENTS.md, docs/README.md, and docs/sprints/sprint-01-ssot.md.
# Key invariants:
# 1. src/core/ must be pure ES Modules (Zero DOM/Web API, Zero external runtime dependencies).
# 2. Develop on feat/sprint-NN-<task-slug> branches branched off 'develop'. Never commit to 'main'.
# 3. Always create an audit record in docs/changelog/YYYY-MM/ and update CHANGELOG.md before finishing any task.
